^{:go/end 480} (go/method Cmp "Cmp compares x and y and returns:\n  - -1 if x < y;\n  - 0 if x == y;\n  - +1 if x > y.\n" [^{:tag (* Int)} x ^{:tag (* Int)} y] :results [^int r]
  ;; x cmp y == x cmp y
  ;; x cmp (-y) == x
  ;; (-x) cmp y == y
  ;; (-x) cmp (-y) == -(x cmp y)
  (switch
    (case [(== x y)])
    ;; nothing to do
    (case [(== (.-neg x) (.-neg y))]
      (set! r (.cmp (.-abs x) (.-abs y)))
      (when (.-neg x)
        (set! r (- r))))

    (case [(.-neg x)]
      (set! r -1))
    (default
      (set! r 1)))

  (return))






